<h3 id="videofront">VideoFront - Recife/PE <span>2017 — 2022</span></h3>
<h4>CTO / Product Owner / Innovation and New Products / Marketing</h4>

<p>My journey at VideoFront began within CERS, where I developed innovative solutions to stand out from competitors.
    However, it soon became clear that other Distance Learning companies were facing similar challenges.
    That’s when VideoFront was born.</p>

<p>At VideoFront, I took on the roles of CTO, Marketing, and Development.
    In the beginning, I worked almost 16 hours a day, without weekends, to create as many products as possible for our portfolio.
    To better understand the clients’ needs, I visited institutions and often spent days there, fully immersed in their specific requirements.</p>

<p>In addition to building a very solid and stable video library with a beautiful and practical player, I also developed a system that detected piracy and blocked students who downloaded videos without authorization — the <a href="https://abed.org.br/seminario2018/institucional_Videofront.pdf" target="_blank">LiveSparrow</a>.
    Many of those who downloaded videos were doing so to resell them: <a href="https://g1.globo.com/jornal-nacional/noticia/2020/07/21/policia-prende-quadrilha-que-pirateava-cursos-preparatorios-para-concursos-publicos.ghtml" target="_blank">https://g1.globo.com/jornal-nacional/noticia/2020/07/21/policia-prende-quadrilha-que-pirateava-cursos-preparatorios-para-concursos-publicos.ghtml</a>.
    Soon after, we filed with the INPI the first <a href="https://revistas.inpi.gov.br/pdf/Patentes2573.pdf" target="_blank">100% piracy-proof LMS</a>, in which it was impossible to download videos or PDF files, and that also featured online exam proctoring.</p>

<p>In 2019, I also ventured into AI and took a <a href="https://www.facebook.com/krausead/posts/pfbid02A3Mq2ZMacCwCnMbju1MwaxpjWRyr3d1YQisp9CqjYMaybUWUEmVyf1tPnCnFDApRl" target="_blank">course at AWS Brazil</a>, after which we began offering AI-based solutions. This culminated in 2020 with <a href="https://www.facebook.com/krausead/posts/pfbid0yPEJvDv6CMYWUkfSEiFf6W4dUXgoL8zNzFDJYbjGwK8VNHA3CRQ4LyvfqQt9gia5l" target="_blank">VideoFront winning the “Most Digital Company of 2020” award</a>.
    I created several AI-powered products for Distance Learning. That year, we started <a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20190104020942/https://www.videofront.com.br/" target="_blank">with three products</a> and later developed <a href="https://videofront.com.br/eadmeeting" target="_blank">EADMeeting</a>, as well as the AI-based <a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20210924173343/https://www.videofront.com.br/pt/face-authentic/" target="_blank">FaceAuthentic</a> and <a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20210924180946/https://www.videofront.com.br/pt/transcription/" target="_blank">Transcription</a>.</p>

<p>At the <a href="https://www.facebook.com/photo?fbid=2775906045755234" target="_blank">ABED Conference in Poços de Caldas</a>, I had the honor of being <a href="https://www.facebook.com/krausead/posts/pfbid0vystTcsfbPMjJfczSemKhGrjMv3NrAq2UvAQesFuJoDmE8Y36cWnkodNuy8n6BTil" target="_blank">invited by João Vianney</a> to dine with a team of EAD giants along with the Hoper team — and that’s where the idea for OTTFlix was born.
    I created the first version of <a href="https://ebradiflix.com.br/Serie" target="_blank">OTTFlix, which is still available today through Ebradi</a>, allowing students who purchased content to continue accessing it.
    <a href="https://www.ottflix.com.br/" target="_blank">Today, OTTFlix</a> has evolved into a fully AI-driven platform, where a teacher can upload a lecture video, and it is automatically transformed into a variety of materials such as books, mind maps, quizzes, short video suggestions, and more.</p>

<h4>Main Achievements:</h4>

<ul>
    <li><a href="https://abed.org.br/seminario2018/institucional_Videofront.pdf" target="_blank">Built a video library from scratch</a>, customized to clients’ needs, featuring shared resources such as subtitles, analytics, and a unified player.</li>
    <li>Developed an AI system for automatic class subtitling, improving accessibility and meeting student demands.</li>
    <li>Created an intelligent system for video conversion resource allocation based on demand, ensuring servers only ran when necessary — optimizing resource use.</li>
    <li>Developed plugins and integrations for accessing the VideoFront library from Cordova and Moodle platforms.</li>
    <li>Designed the Kapture environment, enabling remote class recording and reducing reliance on expensive studios.</li>
    <li>Developed EADMeeting, a live streaming and videoconferencing environment to enhance interaction between teachers and students.</li>
    <li>Created a facial recognition system powered by AI to authenticate students in online exams, ensuring course integrity — even before the pandemic.</li>
    <li>Developed several applications, including “QG do ENEM no Bolso,” “EADMeeting,” “Sebrae PA,” and “EbradiFlix.”</li>
</ul>

